Rails Agents is mounted at /agents.

Next steps:

  1. Start your app:  bin/dev
  2. Open:            http://localhost:3000/agents
  3. Sign up with GitHub or email (4-digit code)
  4. Describe your agent in chat — files write to app/agents/
  5. Hit Test, then Deploy when ready

Docs: https://meerkatagents.com/docs/getting-started
